---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import HexensTechPartner from '../images/hexens-tech-partner.png'
---

<section class="py-8 md:py-16" id="tech-partner">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="md:grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 xl:gap-6 2xl:gap-16 items-center">
            <div class="order-first md:order-last mb-6 md:mb-0">
                <Image class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-700 h-32 md:h-auto w-full object-cover" src={HexensTechPartner} alt="Hexens Abstract Background" width={1200} />
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="font-bold uppercase mb-4 bg-primary inline-block text-gray-950 px-3 py-2">
                    //Tech Partners
                </div>
                <div class="font-bold uppercase text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-5xl tracking-tighter">
                    Remedy by Hexens. 360º cybersecurity platform
                </div>
                <p class="lg:text-lg text-gray-300 font-normal my-6">
                    Hexens supported Decode Travel through its web3 security ecosystem Remedy by providing free access to all participants. Remedy is a one-stop shop for cutting-edge technologies purpose-built to empower the complete security lifecycle of Web3 projects. Remedy includes: bug bounty program, ZK Storage and Glider - ultimate query engine scanning deployed smart contracts across all EVM chains.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
